**Implemented June 2024.** Intake merges a report into the open ticket whose subject line matches, after
lowercasing and stripping punctuation — fast, nobody reads the body. Why: [decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject).
How the desk runs it: [triage](/kb/triage/dedupe).

What it cost: #4471 merged two different causes under shared subjects ([#4471 split](/kb/incidents/4471-split)).
The proposed change is its own task: [split by cause before known](/kb/tasks/split-by-cause).

